This source-only copy carries application-required corrections:
src/vrm/mtoon/outline_pass.rs clears MToonMaterialInstances on extraction.
Otherwise removed native material components remain queued for native outlines
after a switch to RichMtoonMaterial, whose extra uniform binding is incompatible
with the native pipeline. Asset ownership and shader behavior are unchanged.
One trailing-space-only doc comment cleanup is in mtoon/material/outline.rs.

src/vrm/gltf/materials.rs applies the VRMC_materials_mtoon specification defaults
to optional material properties, and glTF identity defaults (offset 0, scale 1)
to omitted texture extensions and UV transform components. This permits valid
VRM 1.0 materials without exporter-specific placeholder properties to load as
MToon. Required specification versions and texture indices remain required.

Examples, documentation, test assets, and repository metadata are not vendored.
